      "text": "How to Observe a Flower is a social art installation by resident artist Tosha Stimage. Stimage is a Berkeley based artist who uses a range of materials to create language that lends itself to the idea of hope. In an unfolding exhibition at Dream Farm Commons, Stimage will activate the space and engage the audience in a series of visual and social offerings using flowers as the theme.",
